@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 65
hide footbox
title UC04 生成借阅统计报表顺序图
actor "馆长" as D
boundary ReportUI as UI
control ReportController as C
entity BorrowRecord as Loan
entity BorrowStat as Stat
D -> UI : requestReport(start, end)
UI -> C : buildReport(start, end)
alt start >= end
 C --> UI : 返回时间区间错误
else 时间区间有效
 C -> Loan : queryCompleted(start, end)
 Loan --> C : completedRecords
 C -> Stat : generate(completedRecords, start, end)
 Stat --> C : report
 alt completedRecords 非空
  C --> UI : 借阅统计报表
 else completedRecords 为空
  C --> UI : 零值报表与暂无已完成借阅提示
 end
end
UI --> D : 展示统计结果
note over C,Loan
只查询 COMPLETED 且 start <= returnedAt < end 的记录。
不统计待借出、借出中或预约记录。
end note
@enduml
